y=pic('phase_comparison',y);y=text('Figure 1. N8 PBC, h>0. The ED reference and raw B3 results at three noise levels use frozen D3 and the same color scale. Colors show phase-like estimates; crosses mark failed preparations. The notebook shows reference coverage separately.',y,8)
